### =============================================================
### <Resource> — full coverage HTTP test suite
### Covers every action, filter, validation rule and error path
### exposed by <discovered-view-path>.
### =============================================================

### Variables
@base_url = http://localhost:<port>/<api-prefix>
@access_token = {{ login.response.body.access }}
@first_id = {{ list.response.body.results.0.id }}
@nonexistent_id = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### =============================================================
### 1. AUTHENTICATION
### =============================================================

### 1.1 Signin (success)
# @name login
POST <signin-url-from-project>
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "<from-config-or-env-example>",
    "password": "<from-config-or-env-example>"
}

### =============================================================
### 2. <RESOURCE> LIST
### =============================================================

### 2.1 Default list
# @name list
GET {{ base_url }}/<resource>/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}

### =============================================================
### 7. <RESOURCE> DETAIL
### =============================================================

### 7.1 GET by ID
GET {{ base_url }}/<resource>/{{ first_id }}/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}

### 7.2 GET non-existent (expect 404)
GET {{ base_url }}/<resource>/{{ nonexistent_id }}/
Authorization: Bearer {{ access_token }}

### =============================================================
### N. AUTH / METHOD ERRORS
### =============================================================

### N.1 No auth header (expect 401)
GET {{ base_url }}/<resource>/
